==Battleground==
*1 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Wafer Cat XL (Enemy)|Wafer Cat XL]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

